cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. Please also cite the dataset publications and the U-Net paper listed in the README."
type: software
title: "Cross-Dataset Generalization of U-Net for Colorectal Polyp Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Research code for a controlled study of how a U-Net trained on one public colonoscopy dataset (Kvasir-SEG or CVC-ClinicDB)
  performs on the other without fine-tuning: dataset audit, fixed splits, training, evaluation, statistics and figures.
  Research code in progress; not peer reviewed.
authors:
  - alias: "Arthurmyn"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Arthurmyn/polyp-segmentation-generalization"
keywords:
  - polyp segmentation
  - colorectal polyp
  - U-Net
  - medical image segmentation
  - cross-dataset generalization
  - domain shift
  - Kvasir-SEG
  - CVC-ClinicDB
